{"seq":1,"slug":"air-pollution-control","title":"大气污染与治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/pollution-remediation/pollution-by-sphere/air-pollution-control","wordCount":1921,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"大气污染与治理\">大气污染与治理</h1><p>大气是污染传播最快、影响人群最广的介质——一座燃煤电厂的排放可以在几小时内笼罩整座城市，一场跨境沙尘可以让千里之外的天空变黄。也正因为空气无法被&quot;圈起来&quot;治理，大气污染防治发展出了一套独特的逻辑：既要在排放口装末端设备拦截，又要在区域尺度协同管控前体物。这一篇专注于大气这个圈层的标志性污染物（颗粒物与光化学产物）及其治理工程，至于污染物在大气中扩散与转化的通用物理规律，已在 <a href=\"../pollution-foundations/fate-and-transport\">污染物在环境中的迁移转化</a> 中建立，这里只调用不重复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>大气污染指有害物质进入大气、其浓度超过环境承载力并危害健康或生态的现象。从治理角度看，最重要的区分是颗粒物与气态污染物，以及一次与二次污染物（这组区分见 <a href=\"../pollution-foundations/pollutant-types-sources\">污染物类型与来源</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  SRC[排放源&lt;br/&gt;燃煤 机动车 工业] --&gt; PM[一次颗粒物&lt;br/&gt;烟尘 黑碳]&#10;  SRC --&gt; SO2[二氧化硫]&#10;  SRC --&gt; NOX[氮氧化物]&#10;  SRC --&gt; VOC[挥发性有机物]&#10;  SO2 --&gt;|氧化| SUL[硫酸盐]&#10;  NOX --&gt;|氧化| NIT[硝酸盐]&#10;  VOC --&gt; SOA[二次有机气溶胶]&#10;  SUL --&gt; PM25[PM2.5&lt;br/&gt;细颗粒物]&#10;  NIT --&gt; PM25&#10;  SOA --&gt; PM25&#10;  PM --&gt; PM25&#10;  NOX --&gt;|阳光 链反应| O3[臭氧/光化学烟雾]&#10;  VOC --&gt;|阳光 链反应| O3&#10;  PM25 --&gt; HEALTH[健康损害&lt;br/&gt;心肺 神经系统]&#10;  O3 --&gt; HEALTH\">flowchart TD\n  SRC[排放源&lt;br/&gt;燃煤 机动车 工业] --&gt; PM[一次颗粒物&lt;br/&gt;烟尘 黑碳]\n  SRC --&gt; SO2[二氧化硫]\n  SRC --&gt; NOX[氮氧化物]\n  SRC --&gt; VOC[挥发性有机物]\n  SO2 --&gt;|氧化| SUL[硫酸盐]\n  NOX --&gt;|氧化| NIT[硝酸盐]\n  VOC --&gt; SOA[二次有机气溶胶]\n  SUL --&gt; PM25[PM2.5&lt;br/&gt;细颗粒物]\n  NIT --&gt; PM25\n  SOA --&gt; PM25\n  PM --&gt; PM25\n  NOX --&gt;|阳光 链反应| O3[臭氧/光化学烟雾]\n  VOC --&gt;|阳光 链反应| O3\n  PM25 --&gt; HEALTH[健康损害&lt;br/&gt;心肺 神经系统]\n  O3 --&gt; HEALTH</pre><p>下表列出主要大气污染物及其治理对策的对应关系。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>污染物</th>\n<th>主要来源</th>\n<th>健康/环境危害</th>\n<th>主流治理技术</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PM2.5</td>\n<td>燃烧、二次生成</td>\n<td>心肺疾病、过早死亡</td>\n<td>除尘 + 控前体物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{SO_2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">S</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>燃煤、冶炼</td>\n<td>酸雨、呼吸刺激</td>\n<td>烟气脱硫（FGD）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{NO_x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>高温燃烧</td>\n<td>酸雨、臭氧前体</td>\n<td>脱硝（SCR/SNCR）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VOCs</td>\n<td>涂装、油气</td>\n<td>臭氧前体、致癌</td>\n<td>吸附、催化燃烧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>臭氧 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{O_3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>二次生成</td>\n<td>损伤肺、伤作物</td>\n<td>协同削减 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{NO_x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>+VOCs</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"pm2-5-为什么细颗粒物如此致命\">PM2.5：为什么细颗粒物如此致命</h2><p>颗粒物按空气动力学直径分级，PM10 指直径不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\ \\mu m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 的颗粒，PM2.5 指不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.5</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.5\\ \\mu m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 的细颗粒。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.5</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.5\\ \\mu m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 这条线不是随意划的——它是颗粒能否穿过呼吸道防御、深入肺泡甚至进入血液的临界尺寸。粗颗粒大多被鼻腔和上呼吸道拦住，而 PM2.5 可直达肺泡进行气体交换的部位，其表面还吸附着重金属和多环芳烃，相当于把毒物直接送进血液。</p>\n<p>PM2.5 的另一个特点是它很大一部分是二次生成的：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{SO_2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">S</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{NO_x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{NH_3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、VOCs 在大气中经氧化反应生成硫酸盐、硝酸盐、铵盐和二次有机气溶胶。这意味着只控制烟囱里直接排出的烟尘远远不够，必须同时削减这些气态前体物——这是大气治理比水土治理更需要&quot;区域协同&quot;的根本原因。</p>\n<p>这一污染物的健康代价是触目惊心的。根据 State of Global Air 2025 报告（健康效应研究所，2025 年 10 月发布），2023 年长期暴露于环境 PM2.5 导致全球约 490 万人死亡，若计入家庭空气污染和臭氧，全部大气污染相关死亡约 790 万，其中 86%（约 680 万）死于非传染性疾病；印度和中国合计占全球死亡负担的 56%（来源：State of Global Air 2025，<a href=\"https://www.stateofglobalair.org/resources/report/state-global-air-report-2025）。这些数字解释了为什么\">https://www.stateofglobalair.org/resources/report/state-global-air-report-2025）。这些数字解释了为什么</a> PM2.5 是各国空气质量标准的首要管控对象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"光化学烟雾与臭氧-阳光下的二次污染\">光化学烟雾与臭氧：阳光下的二次污染</h2><p>如果说 PM2.5 是&quot;看得见的脏&quot;，光化学烟雾就是&quot;看不见的毒&quot;。它是典型的二次污染：氮氧化物和挥发性有机物在强紫外线下发生复杂的链式光化学反应，生成臭氧、过氧乙酰硝酸酯（PAN）和醛类等强氧化性物质。1940 年代的洛杉矶光化学烟雾事件让人类第一次认识到，污染物可以在大气中&quot;二次合成&quot;出原本没有排放的毒物。</p>\n<p>臭氧治理的反直觉之处在于它的非线性。臭氧生成同时受 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{NO_x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 VOCs 控制，但两者的影响并不简单叠加：在某些区域（VOCs 控制区），单独削减 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{NO_x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 反而会让臭氧升高，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{NO}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">NO</span></span></span></span></span></span> 本身能消耗臭氧。这就是为什么近地面臭氧成为越来越多城市在 PM2.5 改善后面临的&quot;新难题&quot;——它需要精细诊断当地处于哪种控制机制，再决定优先削减哪种前体物，而不能套用统一公式。这种前体物与产物错位的治理逻辑，正是 <a href=\"../pollution-foundations/pollutant-types-sources\">污染物类型与来源</a> 中二次污染物概念在大气中的具体体现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"末端治理工程-除尘-脱硫-脱硝\">末端治理工程：除尘、脱硫、脱硝</h2><p>对固定点源（电厂、钢厂、水泥厂），大气治理的主力是烟气末端处理，按目标污染物分三大工艺。</p>\n<p>除尘去除颗粒物，主流是静电除尘器（利用高压电场使颗粒荷电后被收集，对细颗粒效率可超 99%）和布袋除尘器（用滤料拦截，对超细颗粒更有效）。脱硫去除 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{SO_2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">S</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，最广泛的是石灰石-石膏湿法烟气脱硫（FGD），原理是用石灰石浆液吸收 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{SO_2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">S</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 生成石膏，反应可简写为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{CaCO_3 + SO_2 + \\tfrac{1}{2}O_2 + 2H_2O \\rightarrow CaSO_4\\cdot 2H_2O + CO_2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">CaC</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">S</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">CaS</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，脱硫副产物石膏还能资源化利用，这是循环经济思路在末端治理中的体现（见 <a href=\"../remediation-governance/pollution-policy-circular-economy\">污染防治政策与循环经济</a>）。脱硝去除 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{NO_x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，主流是选择性催化还原（SCR），在催化剂作用下用氨把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{NO_x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 还原成无害的氮气和水。</p>\n<p>这套&quot;超低排放&quot;组合工艺已让许多电厂的污染物排放浓度接近燃气机组水平。但要注意，末端治理本质上是把污染物从气相转移或转化掉，它解决不了二次颗粒物和臭氧的区域协同问题——那需要从能源结构和移动源上做文章。</p>\n<h2 id=\"区域协同与移动源管控\">区域协同与移动源管控</h2><p>大气污染的最后一块拼图是末端设备管不到的部分：机动车等移动源，以及跨区域传输。移动源排放分散在城市每条道路上，本质是非点源，无法在某个烟囱上拦截，只能靠提高燃油标准、推广电动车、加严尾气限值来从源头削减。</p>\n<p>跨区域传输则让&quot;各扫门前雪&quot;彻底失效——一个城市的空气质量可能有相当比例来自上风向城市的输送。这催生了&quot;联防联控&quot;机制：相邻城市统一应急响应、协同减排。这种从单点治理到区域协同的转变，是大气污染防治区别于水土治理的最大特征，也呼应了风险评估中&quot;暴露情景必须考虑空间尺度&quot;的要求（见 <a href=\"../pollution-foundations/dose-response-risk-assessment\">剂量-效应与环境风险评估</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>大气是传播最快、影响最广的介质，治理需兼顾排放口末端拦截与区域尺度前体物协同管控。</li>\n<li>PM2.5 因能深入肺泡并携带毒物而格外致命，且很大一部分是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{SO_2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">S</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{NO_x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、VOCs 二次生成的，2023 年全球约 490 万人死于其长期暴露。</li>\n<li>光化学烟雾与臭氧是二次污染的典型，治理具非线性，单削 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{NO_x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">N</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在某些区域反而使臭氧升高。</li>\n<li>固定源末端治理三大工艺为除尘、脱硫（FGD）、脱硝（SCR），脱硫副产物可资源化，但解决不了二次污染的区域问题。</li>\n<li>移动源本质是非点源，须从源头削减；跨区域传输催生联防联控，区域协同是大气治理区别于水土治理的最大特征。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大气污染与治理","id":"大气污染与治理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"PM2.5：为什么细颗粒物如此致命","id":"pm2-5-为什么细颗粒物如此致命"},{"level":2,"text":"光化学烟雾与臭氧：阳光下的二次污染","id":"光化学烟雾与臭氧-阳光下的二次污染"},{"level":2,"text":"末端治理工程：除尘、脱硫、脱硝","id":"末端治理工程-除尘-脱硫-脱硝"},{"level":2,"text":"区域协同与移动源管控","id":"区域协同与移动源管控"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"剂量-效应与环境风险评估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/pollution-remediation/pollution-foundations/dose-response-risk-assessment"},"next":{"title":"水体污染与富营养化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/pollution-remediation/pollution-by-sphere/water-pollution-eutrophication"}}